OL,3,GNEWSAJury out in trial of police
OL,4,Aofficer accused of island rapes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe jury in the trial of a police
OL,7,Fofficer accused of rape in Shetland has
OL,8,Fretired to consider a verdict.
OL,10,FCarmichael John Williamson - known as
OL,11,FJohn Williamson - is on trial at the
OL,12,FHigh Court in Edinburgh.
OL,14,FThe 32-year-old is accused of having
OL,15,Fsexual activity with a girl when she
OL,16,Fwas under-age in 2014, and raping her
OL,17,Fbetween 2014 and 2015. It is also
OL,18,Falleged he raped a woman in 2020, and
OL,19,Fthen in 2022 while she was intoxicated
OL,20,Fand unable to consent.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
