OL,3,GNEWSAJury out in trial of police
OL,4,Aofficer accused of island rapes
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn the third day of the trial,
OL,7,Fprosecution and defence closing
OL,8,Fspeeches were heard before judge John
OL,9,FMorris KC charged the jury and sent
OL,10,Fthem out to begin their deliberations.
